## Tools for Observing Processes and Threads

### Linux/Unix Tools

1. **ps** - List running processes
   ```bash
   ps aux                    # Show all processes with details
   ps -eLf                   # Show processes with threads
   ```

2. **top** - Real-time process monitoring
   ```bash
   top                       # Interactive process viewer
   top -H                    # Show threads
   ```

3. **htop** - Enhanced version of top
   ```bash
   htop                      # Enhanced interactive process viewer
   htop -H                   # Show threads
   ```

4. **pstree** - Display process tree
   ```bash
   pstree                    # Show parent-child process relationships
   ```

5. **lsof** - List open files by processes
   ```bash
   lsof -p <PID>            # Show files opened by a process
   ```

6. **strace** - Trace system calls
   ```bash
   strace <command>         # Trace system calls made by a process
   ```

### Windows Tools

1. **Task Manager** - GUI process viewer (Ctrl+Shift+Esc)
2. **Get-Process** (PowerShell)
   ```powershell
   Get-Process                    # List all processes
   Get-Process | Select-Object Id, Name, Threads
   ```
3. **Process Explorer** - Advanced process monitoring tool
4. **wmic** (Windows Management Instrumentation Command-line)
   ```bash
   wmic process list               # List processes
   wmic process list brief         # Brief process list
   ```

